# FAIRsharing API credentials, used by `uv run --env-file .env fairtox <command>` for the commands that read
# FAIRsharing: site, sheet, export-fairsharing and fairsharing.
# Copy this file to .env (never committed) and fill it in yourself.
#
# FAIRsharing's API does not accept ORCID sign-in. If you sign in to fairsharing.org with ORCID,
# first set a password at https://fairsharing.org/accounts/forgotPassword and make sure your
# FAIRsharing profile names an organisation. Then use your FAIRsharing username or email here.
FAIRSHARING_LOGIN=
FAIRSHARING_PASSWORD=
